There is a life around which nothing tomorrow comes.
明天將帶來嶄新生活

18
00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:08,760
Halt!
停！

19
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,540
Drop!
放下！

20
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:18,760
No, no, no!
不 不 不！

21
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:21,320
No!
不！

22
00:02:21,820 --> 00:02:23,320
He's an innocent woman!
她是無辜的女人！

23
00:02:23,820 --> 00:02:25,320
Let her out!
放她出來！

24
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:27,320
Come on!
拜託！

25
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:29,760
Watch him for the right!
盯著他以防萬一！

26
00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:37,680
Thank you, sir.
謝謝你 先生

27
00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:39,680
Thank you, monsieur.
謝謝你 先生

28
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:41,680
To the barricades!
到路障去！

29
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:43,680
Leave La Proge!
離開 La Proge！

30
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,580
Come on!
拜託！

31
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,420
Come on, Joe!
拜託 Joe！

32
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,740
Come on, get down, get down!
來 蹲下 蹲下！

33
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:01,080
Move out, move out, move out!
前進 前進 前進！

34
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:05,680
Come on, get off your arse, it's begun.
來 動起來 開始了

35
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:09,240
I'm sorry, pal.
對不起 朋友

36
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:11,240
Thank you.
謝謝

37
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:13,240
I'm sorry, I'm going to get turned.
對不起 我要走了

38
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:15,240
Ah, sorry.
啊 抱歉

39
00:03:15,740 --> 00:03:17,240
We need as much furniture as you can throw a dime!
我們需要你能搬的所有家具！

40
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,780
Throw everything you have!
把你有的全部扔出來！

41
00:03:23,780 --> 00:03:28,660
Wait! No! Wait!
等！不！等！

42
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,020
Watch yourself! Watch yourself!
小心點！小心點！

43
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,320
Oh, my God!
噢 我的天！

44
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:48,640
I need a volunteer, someone who can find out their plan and when they will attack.
我需要志願者 能找出他們計劃何時進攻的人

45
00:03:49,660 --> 00:03:58,320
I can find out the truth, I know their ways, fought their wars, served my time, in the
我能找出真相 我認識他們的手段 打過仗 服役過 在

46
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:01,320
days of my youth.
在我年輕的歲月裡

47
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,620
See the people unite!
看人民團結起來！

48
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:06,660
I pray you're right.
我祈求你是對的

49
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:09,000
Dogs will pack.
狼群會聚集

50
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:11,000
Please don't bite!
拜託不要咬！

51
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:13,000
It will do what it strikes!
它會做它該做的！

52
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:25,260
Red, the blood of angry men
紅 憤怒人民的血

53
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:29,220
Black, the dark of ages past
黑 過去時代的黑暗

54
00:04:30,020 --> 00:04:39,840
Red, a world about to dawn Black, the night that ends at dawn
紅 即將破曉的世界 黑 終結於黎明的夜晚
